### Runnable from IntelliJ IDEA / VS Code REST Client against `./mvnw spring-boot:run`.
@host = http://localhost:8080
@customerId = 7f1c1c58-6a55-4c5e-9d5b-2f6f0a6f4b11

### Browse the demo catalogue
GET {{host}}/api/v1/products

### Add a product with only three units
POST {{host}}/api/v1/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sku": "DROP-001",
  "name": "Limited sneaker",
  "price": 1499.90,
  "initialStock": 3
}

### Place an order. Send it twice: the second response is 200 with the same order.
# @name placeOrder
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: checkout-001

{
  "customerId": "{{customerId}}",
  "items": [
    { "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 }
  ]
}

### Pay within the reservation window
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders/{{placeOrder.response.body.id}}/payment

### ...or cancel and return the stock
POST {{host}}/api/v1/orders/{{placeOrder.response.body.id}}/cancellation

### Look at the order
GET {{host}}/api/v1/orders/{{placeOrder.response.body.id}}
